26:5","global_turn_index":460,"locator":"[S26T5]","raw_turn_sha256":"18c8cd5de667f90bbbc0114b506771bf344941852b33a9b649db8600648fe478","rendered_turn_sha256":"0545e051475a5506da033b60967e3905b30308f3b34f55ddeae582adce8c96b6","session_date":"2023-10-25","session_datetime":"2023-10-25T20:25:00","session_id":"session_26","session_index":26,"source_sha256":"294ff547736f1facf0893057babd43757c29a20d60e699758845608a1b10076a","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":5}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-10-15, when Dave (feeling discouraged after his shop lost a deal to a competitor) asked how he stays motivated when faced with setbacks: \"When setbacks come my way, I remind myself why I'm passionate about my goals. I rely on helpful people around me and take a break to recharge with my favorite activities. That always helps me get back to feeling motivated.\" (complements his earlier 2023-07-21 answer about staying motivated, see above) [S23T3][S23T4].\n- On 2023-10-15, said performing with Frank Ocean \"recently has been really cool\" — said while reacting to Dave's music-festival story (see ## Relationships); the Frank Ocean tour he described to Dave on 2023-08-14 as having ended with the Tokyo show predates this remark, which suggests more recent performing with Frank Ocean (details in ## Frank Ocean collaboration; confirmed on 2023-10-19, when he told Dave he has started touring with Frank Ocean — see ## Frank Ocean collaboration) [S23T10].\n- On 2023-10-23, on the balance and pressure of touring/fame (complementing his earlier motivation answers, see above): the tour is incredible and energizing, but fame has its own challenges — balancing it all has been tough; he takes it one day at a time, it can get overwhelming with so many demands, but he enjoys what he does so he pushes on; a strong support system is a key strategy — his friends and team keep him on track [S25T2][S25T4][S25T6].\n- On 2023-10-23, when Dave asked (after Dave shared his good conversation with neighbors about current events and politics) how he stays informed and inspired: staying connected and up-to-date on world events is important to him — it helps his music stand out by incorporating unique perspectives, connects him better with his fans, and keeps him motivated and inspired [S25T8].\n- On 2023-10-23, told Dave (when asked whether anything had caught his eye lately and made an impact on his music, in the context of Dave's remark that art reflects the world): recently he's been really inspired by the struggles that people go through — it's made him dig deeper into his music to try to capture those feelings; when Dave asked whether using his music to share experiences and feelings is cathartic for him, Calvin: yes — it's a way for him to express himself and work through his emotions — \"like my own form of therapy\" (complements his earlier statements on music as self-expression, see above; conversation flow in the 2023-10-23 entry of ## Relationships; Dave's side in the Relationships section of /memories/dave.md) [S25T9][S25T10][S25T11][S25T12].\n- On 2023-10-23, the two agreed that attention to detail makes a big difference — in music or with vehicles, little things can make a big impact (Calvin: details are \"what makes something great, like a well-crafted rap song or a sleek and stylish car\") — and Calvin added that without those details it's just average, and that as an artist he wants to create something extraordinary; he shared a photo of his record (a silver disc in a black frame on a table), and Dave said he loves the attention to detail in Calvin's work — \"it makes it extra special. Keep on creating!\" (conversation flow in the 2023-10-23 entry of ## Relationships; Dave's amp photo in the Music section of /memories/dave.md) [S25T20][S25T21][S25T22][S25T23].\n- On 2023-10-23, thanked Dave for his support — \"Thanks Dave! Appreciate your support!\" [S25T24].\n- On 2023-10-23, in the closing exchange about concerts: music \"brings us together and creates unforgettable memories,\" and it's \"unbeatable in terms of the energy it brings\"; he called concerts what he lives for — \"the indescribable connection between the artist and the crowd is just amazing!\" — and the rush of connecting with everyone at a concert is a feeling that's \"unbeatable\" (complements his 2023-05-31 \"fuels my soul\" remark above; Dave's side in the Music section of /memories/dave.md) [S25T26][S25T28][S25T30].\n- On 2023-10-25, when Dave asked what got him into engineering cars, Calvin said he's \"totally into cars too and love[s] making new and powerful models\" (his own interest in making cars — complements the orange car project he relaxes on, see above, and his finding that working on cars relaxes him \"like meditation\"); seeing Dave work on cars is \"inspiring - it makes me want to keep pushing my music\" (his love of cars also noted in the 2023-10-25 entry of ## Relationships) [S26T5].","text_sha256":"664a5a26a893afc679505e982db6a80ad8912bdf004342728873a5da59960a10","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D29:6","D29:7","D29:8"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":157,"line_start":157,"source_locators":["[S29T6]","[S29T7]","[S29T8]"],"text_sha256":"af24df367c9ba5bf66f72e6d91320b45a8fe14166af17e0395bcd7a7c12ca00f"},{"dia_ids":["D29:9"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":158,"line_start":158,"source_locators":["[S29T9]"],"text_sha256":"78a2705e92fa2eb06807dcd355c18d194ac339c9080c972c3ed57e783aca7473"},{"dia_ids":["D29:11","D29:12"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":159,"line_start":159,"source_locators":["[S29T11]","[S29T12]"],"text_sha256":"e67db0f310eeae9c3fab0f3e7981f5e56888bc12f8c3dc0d247e7a201d43dc6b"},{"dia_ids":["D29:13"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":160,"line_start":160,"source_locators":["[S29T13]"],"text_sha256":"f49f18c6f