Dave's side in the Relationships section of /memories/dave.md) — and he shared a photo of a group of people sitting around a desk (Dave: \"Is this a pic of some musicians you're collaborating with?\" — unanswered in this excerpt) [S29T6][S29T7][S29T8].\n- On 2023-11-13, told Dave he's been supporting some young musicians from a music program — supporting their passion is amazing and their enthusiasm is inspiring [S29T9].\n- On 2023-11-13, said of supporting the young musicians \"it's like a torch being passed to keep music alive!\"; the young musicians are very ambitious and he thinks he will support them for a long time (Dave: \"Your support for them keeps the music going and passes on the legacy.\") [S29T11][S29T12].\n- On 2023-11-13, said he's \"stoked [he] made a difference\" — \"paying it forward\" — and that working with new talent brings new ideas to his work; shared a photo of himself making a beat for a young artist (a photo of a man sitting at a desk in front of a computer), saying the artist has great potential in music (Dave: \"Wow, that's cool! Your music studio looks great.\") [S29T13].\n- On 2023-11-17, told Dave (when asked who he had the most interesting chat with at the fancy Boston gala he attended the day before, 2023-11-16): he had a really interesting conversation with \"this cool artist\" — \"we clicked over music and art\" — and they talked about their favorite artists, art, and \"how the power of music connects us all\"; \"It was such an inspiring conversation - I feel like I'm on a creative high.\" — and shared a photo of the two of them sitting on a bench in the snow (a photo of the artist, not previously named or identified) [S30T4]. Dave: \"That's amazing, Calvin! Music really does bring people together and foster creativity. Glad to hear you had such an inspiring conversation!\" (Dave's side in the Music section of /memories/dave.md; conversation flow in the 2023-11-17 entry of ## Relationships) [S30T5].","text_sha256":"0914a6c85246363b